    - target: {fileID: 4410161414918852657, guid: 0dc33e3ab8d084c448f001f95e4af56f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Text
      value: "I'll never get used to seeing them turn into ghosts... \nPoor kitty.
        Now he's just a floating head, with his body left behind.\r\n\r\nWhat should
        I do?\r\n\r\nI asked the cat if he wanted to be my friend. \nNow we'll be
        wandering around together!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4410161414918852657, guid: 0dc33e3ab8d084c448f001f95e4af56f, type: 3}
