    - target: {fileID: 4410161414918852657, guid: 0dc33e3ab8d084c448f001f95e4af56f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Text
      value: "Whoa! They're coming this way! Hooray!\r\n\r\nThey apologized and said
        they were just afraid of other ghosts. \nBut I'm not like the others! I proudly
        told them!\r\n\r\nThen I gave them some ghost treats!\r\n\r\nNow the three
        of us can wander around together! Hehehe!\r\n\r\nWe have three crystals for
        the ghost records, and each one has its own color!\r\n\r\nHooray! Three for
        each of us, three, three, and three... \nPut them all together and we get
        a rainbow!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4410161414918852657, guid: 0dc33e3ab8d084c448f001f95e4af56f, type: 3}
