    - target: {fileID: 5142507506568417297, guid: 0dc33e3ab8d084c448f001f95e4af56f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Text
      value: 'They''re still scared of me... Maybe I should give them some treats
        from the shop?

        

        No way, Mr. Square-Ball! I''m not giving
        up! I''ll make lots of friends, and I''ll be happy even if I''m a ghost!'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
