    - target: {fileID: 6670967161023202721, guid: 0dc33e3ab8d084c448f001f95e4af56f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Text
      value: 'Whoa! A cat with a ghost! I''m going to make friends with them!

        

        Oh
        no! The ghost and the cat got scared! What should I do?

        

        What''s
        today''s date?

        

        Oh! Family Day! Or, as they say in Russian...
        Semiya!

        

        What a wonderful day! I''ll try to make friends
        with them again!'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
