    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1.79
  m_Text: 'Hello, Agent.

    Your mission is to open the safe.

    Your informants
    can help you crack the code, but they won''t give you their notes willingly.

    You''ll
    need crystals to get them talking.

    There are three generators. Use them
    and the magic crystal to create crystals.

    The crystals will hypnotize the
    informants, making them reveal their notes.'
